---
description: Rails API conventions
globs: app/**/*.rb, config/**/*.rb, db/**/*.rb
alwaysApply: false
---

- API-only: controllers return JSON, no views.
- Controllers live under Api:: and routes under /api.
- Use blueprinter for serialization once responses grow past simple as_json.
- fund_type enum (county_allocation, ng_cdf, ward_dev_fund) must be preserved.